<title>FINLAND: TABLE-Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 808 mln in wk.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 808 mln in wk.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to August 15 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to August 8:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest    Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 64,336	65,144</p>
<p> Money market intervention     9,879	 8,693</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,926	 1,921</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 1,906	 1,908</p>
<p> Other				 8,127	 8,211</p>
<p> Total assets		     86,174	85,877</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>In the previous week to August 8 reserves rose by 669 million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
